Package: zzobj2fig
Title: Generate LaTeX Tables and PDF Outputs
Version: 0.4.0
Authors@R:
    person("Ronald G.", "Thomas", , "rgthomas@ucsd.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-1686-4965"))
Description: Creates LaTeX tables from data frames and statistical
    objects with optional styling, and generates cropped PDF figures.
    Supports multiple output formats, themes for journal styling
    (APA, Nature, NEJM), S3 methods for 'lm' and 'glm' objects, and
    R Markdown integration via a custom 'knitr' engine.
License: GPL (>= 3)
URL: https://github.com/rgt47/zzobj2fig
BugReports: https://github.com/rgt47/zzobj2fig/issues
